# seed: 1
# requires: boot_menu hero_ready map_enter music_play hero_move encounter battle_start
# Map entry resolves music.ini [evergreen] midi1=scrn_overworld.
# Walking south after the eastward leg triggers the retail .mon encounter.
expect boot_menu 900
key RETURN
wait 30
key RETURN
wait 30
# Three states before the Well, not two: 1 main menu -> 2 the
# "Where Do You Want To Play Today?" splash (FUN_0041D31F) -> 3 the world
# list (FUN_0041D717). The original's own table is FUN_0041B891 (all.c:21078);
# the port used to collapse the splash, so the script had drifted. The extra
# RETURN is the plan's keyboard shortcut for the row click (msg 0x474).
key RETURN
wait 30
key n
wait 5
text MusicWalker
key RETURN
expect hero_ready 300
expect map_enter 600
expect music_play 60
hold RIGHT 60
expect hero_move 300
keydown DOWN
expect encounter 1200
keyup DOWN
expect battle_start 600
quit
